  "type": "module",
  "description": "Next.js admin console (/*) and hosted chat (/c/[publicBotId]) — ADR-027. Every version below is pinned EXACT (.npmrc save-exact=true): a caret is how tailwindcss and tailwind-merge drift apart between two installs of the same tree.",
